Hello,

We are happy to announce the release of the 4.0.0 version of the
Buildroot Eclipse plugin. The important changes are:

 * Updated for Eclipse Luna

 * Added the definition of the archiver tool, which allows to build
   static libraries properly through Eclipse managed builds. Reported
   by Oded Hanson.

The Eclipse update site is at
http://buildroot.org/downloads/eclipse/luna/.

See https://github.com/mbats/eclipse-buildroot-bundle/wiki for more
details.

Do not hesitate to report any bug, issue, or make suggestions about
this plugin.

Best regards,

